WEBVTT

00:09:59.547 --> 00:10:01.612
Ophelia going mad,
the play within the play,

00:10:01.636 --> 00:10:03.596
and Yorick's skull, and the gravediggers.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.263
That's in order to delay --

00:10:05.287 --> 00:10:06.922
until Act Five, he can kill him.

00:10:06.946 --> 00:10:08.857
It's the same with the Chopin.

00:10:08.881 --> 00:10:11.293
He's just about to reach the E,

00:10:11.317 --> 00:10:13.920
and he says, "Oops, better
go back up and do it again."

00:10:14.571 --> 00:10:16.063
So he does it again.

00:10:16.540 --> 00:10:17.768
Now, he gets excited.

00:10:17.792 --> 00:10:19.985
(Music)

00:10:20.009 --> 00:10:21.976
That's excitement, don't worry about it.

00:10:22.000 --> 00:10:24.831
Now, he gets to F-sharp,
and finally he goes down to E,

00:10:25.850 --> 00:10:27.136
but it's the wrong chord --

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:29.373
because the chord
he's looking for is this one,